                                                "sense_id": "f4d5324d-ec61-35c4-bbdc-fb5752378fa7",
                                                "text": "If there is at hand a source of energy of 500 KW., a transformator is needed. In the case of a dynamo as well as in the case of the transformator, the cost is about the same, $8,000, not including the motor."
